## Setup Instructions
### Backend (FastAPI)

1. Navigate to backend folder:
   cd flutter_comments_backend

2. Activate virtual environment:
If you face any errors while activating the environment,
Create a new environment with the below command,
python -m venv venv

2. Activate the scripts
venv\Scripts\activate  or .\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps

3. uvicorn main:app --reload
----------------------------------------------------------------

### Frontend (Flutter Web)

1. Navigate to Flutter project:
   cd my_flutter_app

2. Run Flutter Web app:
   To run in chrome - flutter run -d chrome
   To run in Edge   - flutter run -d edge

App will open in your default browser.

